        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-06-12T02:52:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thought:</p><p>Do we know which came first, Dark Watch or Vengeance?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If DW is after Vengeance (for some reason I think it is, but I can't remember if it is valid) could the Fixer Tatoo have come from a story arc against Zhu Long, after the Chairman's defeat?</p><p>Maybe Slim goes hunting when the Operative and Pike vanish, and there is an awesome Fixer vs. Zhu Long series. &nbsp;Maybe even a war out of Fixer's past, that he thought he left behind. (like the Gambit - thieves guild thing)</p><p>It would be cool if a young Mr. Fixer was involved in a gang but got out, only to see his star pupil join the gang he left.</p><p>A story where he tries to save her, returning to the gang wars, they defeat Zhu Long only to see The Operative choose a life of crime afterward would be awesome. &nbsp;It would also let The Operative be a hero for a bit, and Fixer + Operative would be amazing.</p>",
