        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/foote/{size}/1877_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-06-12T03:37:29.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Dude I love it. That's some awesome stuff. It makes me wonder though. Every gang needs a leader right? If we are running with a rival gangs theory, and Zuh long is heading the read team, who mans blue?</p><p>Nightmist was mentored by The Chinese Master as per her bio. Maybe he isn't just some throwaway character. Also working off the \"fixer with no hat =dead\" thing, maybe Nightmist goes to see her old master about resurrecting Fixer (presumably killed by the Operative). This prompts her to search out the Staff of Anubis and the idol of anput. She then brings Fixer back with the masters help and her new found power.</p><p>But there is a cost it seems. Fixer is now forced back into this gang war as payment. Bitter Strike right? Add the who backstory of fixer maybe being in this gang before, teaching operative only to have her end up killing him, and that would be good reason to be bitter.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
